 DemoCoordProp connected;F
⍝ Coord 'Prop': Posn and Size are percentages - of the screen (the browser
⍝ viewport) for a Form, of the parent's interior for everything inside it.
⍝ Children inherit the Form's Coord. F1.INPUT is a Pixel strip holding the demo
⍝ menu; F1.G.PX is a Pixel child of a Prop parent. Report shows what eWG returns,
⍝ in each object's own units; Grow resizes the Group so its children follow.
⍝ F1.BR is Prop with attached edges: it keeps its px gap to the Form's corner.
 EWC.CONNECTED←connected
 F←'F1'
 F eWC'Form' 'Coord Prop'('Coord' 'Prop')('Posn'(5 5))('Size'(80 70))
 (F,'.INPUT')eWC'SubForm'('Coord' 'Pixel')('Posn'(0 0))('Size'(34 460))
 (F,'.INPUT.DEMO')eWC'SubForm'('Flex' 'row')
 (F,'.G')eWC'Group' 'Group'('Posn'(15 5))('Size'(40 45))
 (F,'.G.B')eWC'Button' 'In group'('Posn'(30 10))('Size'(25 80))
 (F,'.G.PX')eWC'Button' 'Pixel'('Coord' 'Pixel')('Posn'(170 8))('Size'(24 70))
 (F,'.SF')eWC'SubForm'('Posn'(15 55))('Size'(40 40))('BCol'(230 240 255))
 (F,'.SF.L')eWC'Label' 'Label'('Posn'(10 10))('Size'(15 80))
 (F,'.SF.E')eWC'Edit'('Text' 'Edit')('Posn'(35 10))('Size'(15 80))
 (F,'.SF.C')eWC'Combo'('Items'('One' 'Two'))('SelItems'(1 0))('Posn'(60 10))('Size'(15 80))
 (F,'.LS')eWC'List'('Items'('One' 'Two' 'Three'))('Posn'(60 5))('Size'(25 30))
 (F,'.REPORT')eWC'Button' 'Report'('Posn'(60 40))('Size'(8 20))('Event' 'Select' 'CBCoordProp')
 (F,'.GROW')eWC'Button' 'Grow'('Posn'(70 40))('Size'(8 20))('Event' 'Select' 'CBCoordProp')
 (F,'.OUT')eWC'Label' ''('Posn'(85 5))('Size'(10 70))
 (F,'.BR')eWC'Button' 'Pinned'('Posn'(88 80))('Size'(6 15))('Attach' 'Bottom' 'Right' 'Bottom' 'Right') ⍝ % at first, then a fixed px gap to the bottom-right
 ⍝ Graphics in Prop: Points, Size and Radius are % of the parent too (Radius of its width).
 ⍝ Circle and Ellipse draw only pie segments (Start), so each gets two halves.
 (F,'.GR')eWC'SubForm'('Posn'(58 65))('Size'(26 30))('BCol'(255 255 255))
 (F,'.GR.POLY')eWC'Poly'('Points'((10 10 40)(10 40 10)))('FCol'(0 0 0))('FillCol'(200 80 80))('FStyle' 0)
 (F,'.GR.RECT')eWC'Rect'('Points'(50 10))('Size'(30 30))('FCol'(0 0 0))('FillCol'(80 160 80))('FStyle' 0)
 (F,'.GR.ELL')eWC'Ellipse'('Points'(50 55))('Size'(30 40))('Start'(0 3.1416))('ArcMode' 2)('FCol'(⊂0 0 0))('FStyle'(0 0))('FillCol'((80 80 200)(160 160 240)))
 (F,'.GR.CIRC')eWC'Circle'('Points'(25 75))('Radius' 10)('Start'(0 3.1416))('ArcMode' 2)('FCol'((220 180 0)(250 220 100)))('FStyle' ¯1)
